。這裡不只是拉麵店，更像是一處深夜心靈與味蕾的避風港，木質調的攤車設計在夜色中散發溫暖微光，營造出濃厚的日本街頭氛圍。\n### 味覺核心：博多豚骨與關東煮\n其靈魂在於**博多豚骨拉麵**。湯頭經長時間熬煮，質地濃郁卻不顯油膩，入喉後帶有淡淡奶香與膠質感，完美包裹著細硬麵體。叉燒經過炙燒處理，焦香與油脂交織出層次感。更具特色的是，店內同步販售高品質的**關東煮**，食材吸飽了清甜的高湯，沾上店家秘製的高湯沾醬，是拉麵之餘最完美的點綴。\n### 空間與體驗\n儘管空間不大，但赤麵廠巧妙運用吧檯位置，縮短了主廚與食客間的距離。在喧囂的新莊四維路中，這裡提供了一種**慢節奏的儀式感**。無論是想獨自享用一碗熱騰騰的麵，還是與友人在攤車旁小酌，這裡的性價比與服務溫度，都讓赤麵廠成為當地極具代表性的特色食肆。\n**店家亮點：** 營業至深夜，是新莊人心中不折不扣的靈魂宵夜首選。",null,[0,117]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVldGR09USk9hekZ4VmxWYVJXTXpUbEpSYkZKeldERldZVTVWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVldGR09USk9hekZ4VmxWYVJXTXpUbEpSYkZKeldERldZVTVWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVldGR09USk9hekZ4VmxWYVJXTXpUbEpSYkZKeldERldZVTVWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVldGR09USk9hekZ4VmxWYVJXTXpUbEpSYkZKeldERldZVTVWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVldGR09USk9hekZ4VmxWYVJXTXpUbEpSYkZKeldERldZVTVWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVldGR09USk9hekZ4VmxWYVJXTXpUbEpSYkZKeldERldZVTVWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2861,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psVWFGOTJOazFxVlVaRWMzTlJRbFJzWDFWYU5VRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xda55827bc208b58f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjlUaF92Nk1qVUZEc3NRQlRsX1VaNUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psVWFGOTJOazFxVlVaRWMzTlJRbFJzWDFWYU5VRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026