KAk",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_SPACE_AVAILABILITY"],"這裡的停車情況如何？",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_DIFFICULT_TO_FIND"],"停車不方便",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjE9bn0uNeWAxUqhq8BHc8hKUUQ3YcHCKMBKAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwjE9bn0uNeWAxUqhq8BHc8hKUUQ3IcHCKIBKAo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_PARKING_LOT"],"付費停車位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjE9bn0uNeWAxUqhq8BHc8hKUUQ3YcHCKUBKAA"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwjE9bn0uNeWAxUqhq8BHc8hKUUQ3IcHCKQBKAs",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjE9bn0uNeWAxUqhq8BHc8hKUUQ3YcHCKcBKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjE9bn0uNeWAxUqhq8BHc8hKUUQ3IcHCKYBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這間拉麵店藏在市場裡，已經營業很多年，是我反覆回訪的老店，也承載了不少回憶。環境或許樸實，但味道始終穩定，這點最難得。拉麵湯頭濃郁順口，不會過鹹，麵條口感彈牙，內用加麵的份量吃完也很有飽足感。\n\n除了拉麵，關東煮也值得一提，食材入味不死鹹，搭配店家提供的醬料與芥末特別提味，讓整體層次更鮮明。多年來水準維持得很好，沒有因時間而走樣。對我來說，這不只是市場裡的一碗拉麵，而是一間會讓人想持續支持、偶爾就想回來吃一碗的店。",null,[0,96]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDFwV1NuWlZSVzk2WlZSc2FGcFlVa1pTU0doNFZFZFpOVlJ0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDFwV1NuWlZSVzk2WlZSc2FGcFlVa1pTU0doNFZFZFpOVlJ0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDFwV1NuWlZSVzk2WlZSc2FGcFlVa1pTU0doNFZFZFpOVlJ0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDFwV1NuWlZSVzk2WlZSc2FGcFlVa1pTU0doNFZFZFpOVlJ0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUV